## 3. The Hyperfactored Collapse: Two Tiny Core Modules (~160 Lines Total)

By exploiting every piece of §2 above, the **entire** chip-design foundation reduces to **two minimal bridge modules**—everything else is compact algebra tables and domain instantiations.

### Module A: `lib/silicon/graph.hypercubical` (~80 lines) — Open Operator DAG, Universal Fold, Product Algebra, Monoid-Tree & Index Transport

```text
-- 1. Table-driven operator signature and open DAG (wires = variables)
SigOp : Type 1
SigOp = (Op : Type) × (Op → Nat)

data Dag (S : SigOp) (V : Type) =
  | wire (v : V)
  | gate (op : fst S) (ins : Vec (Dag S V) (snd S op))

-- 2. Algebra, universal fold, homomorphism theorem, and product algebra
Alg : (S : SigOp) → Type → Type
Alg S R = (op : fst S) → Vec R (snd S op) → R

fold : {S : SigOp} {V R : Type} → Alg S R → (V → R) → Dag S V → R
-- wire v        ↦ env v
-- gate op ins   ↦ alg op (vec-map (fold alg env) ins)

AlgHom : {S : SigOp} {R T : Type} → Alg S R → Alg S T → (R → T) → Type
AlgHom {S} A B h = (op : fst S) → (xs : Vec R (snd S op)) → h (A op xs) ≡ B op (vec-map h xs)

fold-hom : {S : SigOp} {V R T : Type} → (A : Alg S R) → (B : Alg S T) → (h : R → T) →
           AlgHom A B h → (env : V → R) → (d : Dag S V) →
           h (fold A env d) ≡ fold B (λ v → h (env v)) d

alg-prod : {S : SigOp} {R T : Type} → Alg S R → Alg S T → Alg S (R × T)
alg-prod A B op xs = (A op (vec-map fst xs) , B op (vec-map snd xs))

-- 3. Universal Optimization Engine A: Associative Monoid Trees (reusing lib/structure.hypercubical Monoid)
data MTree (A : Type) = mleaf (a : A) | mnode (l : MTree A) (r : MTree A)
-- mtree-eval : Monoid M → MTree M → M
-- mtree-flat : MTree A → List A
-- mtree-equiv : (M : Monoid A) → (t1 t2 : MTree A) → mtree-flat t1 ≡ mtree-flat t2 →
--               mtree-eval M t1 ≡ mtree-eval M t2

-- 4. Universal Optimization Engine B: Univalent Index / Basis Transport (reusing lib/structure.hypercubical Equiv)
-- idx-transport : {I J A : Type} → Equiv I J → (I → A) → (J → A)
-- idx-pkg-transport : transports dependent circuit + spec + cost across ua(e)
```

