3. **Dependent Physical Geometry for Regular Arrays & `GraphSym` LVS:**
   * Systolic arrays, SRAM macros, and interaction-net tile meshes are regular 2D tilings over `SumFin W × SumFin H`. Pitch-matching, mirrored/rotated abutment, DRC spacing invariants, and Manhattan/Elmore wire RC ($RC \propto L^2$) enter the Tropical STA fold *before* P&R—eliminating the post-synthesis physical wire cliff. Extracted layout netlists verify LVS directly via `GraphSym` (`lib/structure.hypercubical`).
4. **Coupled Zero-Guardband Signoff (Switching Power $\to$ IR Drop / Thermal / Maxwell $\to$ Tropical STA):**
