## 8. Operational Commands

1. **Build the machine (if not built):** `make` produces `build/cubical` (symlinked at `./hyperactive`).
2. **Verify the entire substrate stack from `store/`:**
   `./build/cubical --read lib/silicon/all.hypercubical` → `1756 passed, 0 failed`.
3. **Inspect module hashes in `store/`:**
   `./build/cubical --head lib/silicon/all.hypercubical` (and `graph`, `arith`, `clock`, `physics`, `inet`, `synth`, `cpu`, `tensor`, `layout`, `tapeout`, `pnr`, `soc`, `univalent`, `optimal`, `ecc`, `arch`, `quantum`, `emit`, `export`, `hypernet`, `docs/chip-design.md`).
4. **Record edits & update session root:**
   `./build/cubical --record <repo-path> <file>` and `./build/cubical --root` (updating `store/ROOT/root`; zero raw files outside `store/`).

